  {
   "turn_id": "C44-D001",
   "turn_index": 0,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "十二月十一日の準備を手伝える人はいますか。十七時から部屋を使えます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C44-D001-S01",
    "C44-D001-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 0.0,
   "end_sec": 5.799,
   "duration_sec": 5.799
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C44-D002",
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "試験が十六時までなので、準備は休ませてください。十七時四十五分ごろ着きます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C44-D002-S01",
    "C44-D002-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 6.149,
   "end_sec": 12.294,
   "duration_sec": 6.145
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C44-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "わかりました。十八時から三十分、受付を任せてもいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C44-D003-S01",
    "C44-D003-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 12.644,
   "end_sec": 17.715,
   "duration_sec": 5.071
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C44-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "はい。でも、前は一人で片付けをさせられました。今回は担当を外してください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C44-D004-S01",
    "C44-D004-S02",
    "C44-D004-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 18.065,
   "end_sec": 23.934,
   "duration_sec": 5.869
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C44-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "負担が大きかったですね。今回は三人で片付けます。佐藤さんはどうですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C44-D005-S01",
    "C44-D005-S02",
    "C44-D005-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 24.284,
   "end_sec": 30.261,
   "duration_sec": 5.977
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C44-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "仕事が十八時までなので、十八時四十分ごろ着きます。片付けと鍵の返却を引き受けます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C44-D006-S01",
    "C44-D006-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 30.611,
   "end_sec": 38.136,
   "duration_sec": 7.525
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C44-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "私も片付けます。三人目はメールで聞きます。鍵は二十一時までに返してください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C44-D007-S01",
    "C44-D007-S02",
    "C44-D007-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
